    "details": {
      "description": "<p>Primal magic infuses a section of the catacombs, causing the stone itself to roil with anger and crush intruders. The \"area\" of the hazard is the entire battlemap. </p>",
      "disable": "<p>@Check[arcana|dc:31|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Arcana}, @Check[nature|dc:31|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Nature}, @Check[religion|dc:31|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Religion}, or @Check[occultism|dc:31|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Occultism} to banish the primal magic infusing the nearby stone.</p><p>@Check[thievery|dc:31|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Thievery}, @Check[athletics|dc:31|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Athletics}, or @Check[crafting|dc:31|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Crafting} to mitigate the effects by reinforcing the tunnel walls.</p><p>Three total successes are required to disable the hazard (a critical success to Disable a Device counts as two successes). The hazard loses one action in its routine per each success.</p>",
      "isComplex": true,
      "level": {
        "value": 11
      },
      "publication": {
        "authors": "",
        "license": "OGL",
        "remaster": false,
        "title": "Covalon: Whitespire Expedition"
      },
      "reset": "<p>1 day. </p>",
      "routine": "<p>(3 actions) The hazard uses each of its actions to strike a different creature with an Earthen Spike. These strikes do not increment MAP.</p>"
